OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD hails big
OL,4,Avictory in east, but falls short of
OL,5,Amajority
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe far-right Alternative for Germany
OL,8,F(AfD) has won a decisive victory in
OL,9,FGermany's eastern state of
OL,10,FSaxony-Anhalt, far ahead of mainstream
OL,11,Frivals.
OL,13,FBut preliminary results show it has
OL,14,Fgained 43.8% of the vote to the
OL,15,Fconservative CDU's 17.2%, falling short
OL,16,Fof an outright majority needed to
OL,17,Fgovern alone. Tricky negotiations on
OL,18,Fwho will run the state lie ahead.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
